This outline doesn't directly handle real-time IoT data ingestion. You would need to integrate libraries or frameworks (e.g., MQTT, gRPC) for receiving messages from IoT devices and implement a stream processing engine (e.g., Apache Kafka, Spark Streaming) to process the incoming data.

